  "document": "KWXL-LP\nKWXL-LP (98.7 FM) is a high school radio station broadcasting a variety format. Licensed to Tucson, Arizona, United States, the station serves the Tucson area. The station is currently owned by the Tucson Unified School District. KWXL-LP is Tucson's only high school radio station. It is also a news radio station for students who attend Pueblo High Magnet School. Students broadcasting over the radio station are enrolled in a \"Writing/Reporting for Broadcasting\" class with instructor Sarah Walson. Originally started by Douglas Potter, who retired in 2006. Listeners can also find FM 98.7, KWXL on iTunes."
